OL,3,GNEWSAOperator to introduce more
OL,4,Aservices in timetable update
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail operator South Western Railway
OL,7,F(SWR) says it will introduce more
OL,8,Fservices on its mainline and suburban
OL,9,Froutes from mid-December.
OL,11,FIt said the introduction of new
OL,12,Fservices will create more than 4,000
OL,13,Fextra seats on services to and from
OL,14,FLondon Waterloo. The network runs
OL,15,Fthrough Surrey and into Hampshire,
OL,16,FDorset and Wiltshire.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,335,330,200,160,0,100
