OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOperator to introduce more
OL,4,Aservices in timetable update
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs well as new services, SWR has
OL,7,Fre-timed a number of services on the
OL,8,Fline between Woking and Waterloo, in an
OL,9,Fattempt to tackle common causes of
OL,10,Fdelays and reduce disruption across the
OL,11,Fnetwork.
OL,13,FIt added that peak suburban capacity is
OL,14,Fbeing increased where it is needed most
OL,15,Fby building on the introduction of the
OL,16,F60 new, 10-carriage Arterio trains.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
